[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12420.07, "timestamp": "03:27:00", "text": "就像我们在游戏中看到的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12422.71, "timestamp": "03:27:02", "text": "那个……呃，该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12424.309, "timestamp": "03:27:04", "text": "就是聊天直播之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12428.07, "timestamp": "03:27:08", "text": "Angel，她是不是说了些什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12431.03, "timestamp": "03:27:11", "text": "她一生中发生了什么，以及所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12434.309, "timestamp": "03:27:14", "text": "所有那些东西，还有人们都在说“呃”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12437.19, "timestamp": "03:27:17", "text": "评论里都是些“呃，就像你一样”之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12438.79, "timestamp": "03:27:18", "text": "他不应该遭受那样的痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12441.83, "timestamp": "03:27:21", "text": "一切都对，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12444.71, "timestamp": "03:27:24", "text": "就像那样，但想想看，这是一种方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12446.63, "timestamp": "03:27:26", "text": "呃，你可以这样想：大家都出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12450.63, "timestamp": "03:27:30", "text": "那里有他们自己的，就像整个自己的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12453.349, "timestamp": "03:27:33", "text": "经验"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12456.87, "timestamp": "03:27:36", "text": "自己经历过类似悲伤的事情，也后悔过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12460.389, "timestamp": "03:27:40", "text": "很多东西都是这样，对吧？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12462.15, "timestamp": "03:27:42", "text": "我们每个人都在经历很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12465.429, "timestamp": "03:27:45", "text": "东西，对吧？就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12468.229, "timestamp": "03:27:48", "text": "天哪，我说话都语无伦次了。加油，兄弟。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12471.67, "timestamp": "03:27:51", "text": "我也是。我的天啊。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12475.349, "timestamp": "03:27:55", "text": "是啊，但是，我很容易哭……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12479.429, "timestamp": "03:27:59", "text": "这就好比……"}]